OL,3,GNEWSAThree convicted over death of army
OL,4,Aveteran
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing a trial at Hull Crown Court,
OL,7,FLukasz Matusiak, 27, Britney Naylor,
OL,8,F20, and Shaytoyia Farrow, 21, were
OL,9,Ffound guilty of manslaughter but
OL,10,Fcleared of murder. They are due to be
OL,11,Fsentenced on 27 November.
OL,13,FTwo other defendants, Bethany Naylor,
OL,14,F20, and Kristjan Suits, 35, were found
OL,15,Fnot guilty of manslaughter.
